{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/06487b42e234f147c39f160b07531b1c.poster.avif?t=1766428477\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/06487b42e234f147c39f160b07531b1c.webm?t=1766428477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Love or Last Beach Stories \u2014 a sun-drenched, adult story adventure set on a tropical beach.</strong> <br>You're a college student looking for a summer gig and maybe a little flirt. When you land a job at a trendy beach bar, things heat up fast. Beautiful strangers, secret rituals, ancient myths, and choices that matter.  <br>But when the sunsets get stranger and the cocktails start whispering secrets... <br>You realize this summer might change more than your life.  <br>It might change the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/92f72f6d6777ff7febb14550af215a89.poster.avif?t=1766428477\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/92f72f6d6777ff7febb14550af215a89.webm?t=1766428477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78A Sultry, Story-Rich Experience</strong><br>Dive into a branching adult narrative where your choices lead to different endings, steamy scenes, or broken hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78A Bar With Secrets</strong> <br>Discover ancient artifacts, lost rituals, and a hidden conflict beneath the sand. Can love really save the world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Bartend Your Way to Their Hearts</strong><br>Master cocktail recipes and minigames and charm your guests, unlock hidden stories, and shake things up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/76f81f6f0379dc4c43d6f728012b1605.poster.avif?t=1766428477\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/extras/76f81f6f0379dc4c43d6f728012b1605.webm?t=1766428477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Insight Mode </strong><br>Use collected \u201cenergy\u201d to activate special dialogue options and reveal hidden desires or secret paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Light vs. Lust</strong><br>Will you chase pleasure at any cost \u2014 or protect those you love, even at your own expense? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf78Slide Into DMs</strong><br>Build relationships through texts, selfies, and emotional confessions or flirty nudes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For fans of Summer Memories, Leisure Suit Larry, College Kings, and spicy visual novels with a twist.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787390?t=1766428477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/aa5852c143e45f620ef08bfacb8f628ae2404faf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766428477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787390/46c26833dc9e263c15d99fcc2a381364da2b5391